<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 9.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 9.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 9.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold by August 4.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 8.5 trillion lire on July 14, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.88 percent and the average rate at 6.94 percent.</p>
